---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Beranda" description="Pusat informasi akademik resmi FAPERTA INSTIPER Yogyakarta.">
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="hero-noise border-b border-[var(--line)]">
		<div class="container-shell grid items-center gap-10 py-12 sm:py-16 md:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr] md:py-24">
			<div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--leaf)]/20 bg-[var(--leaf-soft)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[var(--leaf)]">
					<span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--gold)]"></span>
					Pusat Informasi Akademik FAPERTA
				</div>
				<h1 class="display-title mt-5 text-4xl leading-[1.1] sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-[var(--leaf)]">
					Semua yang kamu butuhkan untuk <em class="font-extrabold text-[var(--gold)] not-italic underline decoration-[var(--leaf)] decoration-wavy decoration-from-font">melangkah.</em>
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--ink)]">
					Temukan buku panduan, kalender perkuliahan, kurikulum prodi, template skripsi, dan regulasi akademik FAPERTA INSTIPER dalam satu ruang yang tertata rapi.
				</p>
				<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
					<a href="/layanan/permohonan-khs" class="btn-cta text-base">
						✦ Permohonan KHS Online <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-1 font-bold">→</span>
					</a>
					<a href="/unduhan" class="btn-secondary text-base bg-white">
						Unduhan Dokumen
					</a>
					<a href="/faq" class="btn-secondary text-base bg-white">
						FAQ & Aturan
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Quick Highlights Grid -->
			<div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 md:rotate-1">
				<div class="sm:col-span-2 rounded-3xl bg-[var(--leaf)] p-7 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 w-36 h-36 rounded-full bg-[var(--leaf-dark)] opacity-40"></div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
						<span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-white/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-[var(--gold)] uppercase">
							Mulai Dari Sini
						</span>
						<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white/80">TA 2025 / 2026</span>
					</div>
					<h2 class="display-title mt-8 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold !text-white leading-tight">
						Buku Panduan<br />Akademik Resmi
					</h2>
					<div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/20 pt-4">
						<span class="text-xs font-medium !text-white/90">Dokumen pegangan mahasiswa baru & lama</span>
						<a class="touch-target inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-sm text-[var(--gold)] hover:text-white transition" href="/dokumen/buku-panduan-akademik.pdf" download>
							Unduh PDF ↗
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="rounded-3xl bg-white border-2 border-[var(--gold)]/40 p-6 shadow-sm">
					<p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[var(--gold)]">75%</p>
					<p class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold leading-snug text-[var(--ink)]">
						Presensi minimal kuliah<br /><span class="text-xs font-normal text-[var(--muted)]">Syarat wajib mengikuti ujian akhir (UAS)</span>
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="rounded-3xl bg-white border-2 border-[var(--leaf)]/20 p-6 shadow-sm">
					<p class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[var(--leaf)]">8</p>
					<p class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold leading-snug text-[var(--ink)]">
						Semester masa tempuh studi<br /><span class="text-xs font-normal text-[var(--muted)]">Program Sarjana S1 Pertanian</span>
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Quick Resource Nav Section -->
	<section class="container-shell py-16 sm:py-20">
		<div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-end">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Pusat Sumber Daya & Layanan</p>
				<h2 class="section-title text-[var(--ink)]">Cari tahu & ajukan lebih cepat.</h2>
			</div>
			<p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
				Akses panduan studi, format laporan skripsi, dan layanan permohonan administrasi akademik resmi FAPERTA.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
			<a href="/layanan" class="group rounded-3xl border-2 border-[var(--leaf)] bg-[var(--leaf-soft)]/40 p-7 shadow-xs transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
						<span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--leaf)] text-xl text-white font-bold">
							⚡
						</span>
						<span class="badge-online">Baru</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-black text-[var(--leaf)] transition">
						Layanan Akademik Mandiri
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
						Permohonan salinan KHS (Semester 1 - 14), pengajuan ujian khusus, komplain nilai, dan surat izin resmi dalam satu pintu.
					</p>
				</div>
				<span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-[var(--leaf)] group-hover:gap-1.5 transition-all">
					Buka 8 Layanan Akademik →
				</span>
			</a>

			<a href="/unduhan" class="group rounded-3xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-white p-7 shadow-xs transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--leaf)] hover:shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
				<div>
					<span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-[var(--leaf-soft)] text-xl text-[var(--leaf)] font-bold">
						▣
					</span>
					<h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-black text-[var(--ink)] group-hover:text-[var(--leaf)] transition">
						Unduhan Dokumen
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
						Buku panduan, kalender akademik, kurikulum Agroteknologi & Agribisnis, serta template proposal dan skripsi.
					</p>
				</div>
				<span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-[var(--leaf)] group-hover:gap-1 transition-all">
					Lihat semua dokumen →
				</span>
			</a>

			<a href="/faq" class="group rounded-3xl border border-[var(--line)] bg-white p-7 shadow-xs transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--leaf)] hover:shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
				<div>
					<span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-[#fef5e7] text-xl text-[var(--gold)] font-bold">
						?
					</span>
					<h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-black text-[var(--ink)] group-hover:text-[var(--leaf)] transition">
						FAQ & Regulasi Akademik
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
						Penjelasan lengkap aturan presensi, cumlaude, batas Turnitin & AI, serta mekanisme ujian susulan, remidi, dan ujian khusus.
					</p>
				</div>
				<span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-[var(--leaf)] group-hover:gap-1 transition-all">
					Buka pusat bantuan FAQ →
				</span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
